    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Jason Yuan: high-profile interaction / digital product designer; designs interfaces and their metaphors (kinetic type, OS prototypes). Studied Theatre (Northwestern) and Graphic Design (RISD); worked at Sony Music, then Human Interface Designer on the Apple Design Team (2021-2023). Created the widely-shared Mercury OS concept; cofounded MakeSpace (now passed to others); now Founder and Chief Design Officer at New Computer (his own venture). Jonathan: Mercury OS guy, very expensive, rated 2. Work Status Studio: he founded and runs New Computer (LinkedIn + press agree). Senior, founder/CDO-level, ex-Apple, ~8+ yrs. Autonomy 5: founder running his own product company. Twitter @jasonyuandesign.",
